  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/MC_whammy_bar.jpg\" title=\"MC_Whammy_Bar\"><img alt=\"MC_Whammy_Bar\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"312\" src=\"/images/MC_whammy_bar.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/MC_whammy_bar.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>MC_Whammy_Bar</div></div></div>\n<p>MC_Whammy_Bar is a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Skeleton\" title=\"Fade Skeleton\">Ice Fade Skeleton</a> who carries what appears to be a huge mandolin.  He is found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a> Level 3 and is usually surrounded by a lot of <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Fade_Footsoldier\" title=\"Ice Fade Footsoldier\">Ice Fade Footsoldiers</a>.  He is the object of a quest given by <a href=\"/wiki/Tipper_Gourd\" title=\"Tipper Gourd\">Tipper Gourd</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
